{"timestamp":"2026-07-23T05:32:32.379Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The LLVM run reaches `.K` with `NoExc` for all three translated assertions, so the reference semantics supports the complete implementation path. For symbolic proof I’m initially keeping the fixed semantics untouched and using only a compile-time abbreviation for the exact translated function body; that means there is no execution-skipping bridge to justify at Gate A.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-23T05:32:32.380Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_050301fef7dd67ae016a61a76d939881958b5c9ac10ff415e5","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The LLVM run reaches `.K` with `NoExc` for all three translated assertions, so the reference semantics supports the complete implementation path. For symbolic proof I’m initially keeping the fixed semantics untouched and using only a compile-time abbreviation for the exact translated function body; that means there is no execution-skipping bridge to justify at Gate A."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019f8d71-e474-70b2-8119-e8b6a9fabb63"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-23T05:32:57.439Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_050301fef7dd67ae016a61a770558481958997444d926fc1f1","status":"completed","call_id":"call_8cucayBna6hmKsHoxPOsdVWA","name":"apply_patch","input":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /work/verification.k\n+requires \"reference-semantics/semantics.k\"\n+\n+module VERIFICATION-SYNTAX\n+  imports MPY-SYNTAX\n+\n+  // A compile-time abbreviation for the exact term in solution.mpy.\n+  syntax Stmt ::= \"MinPathDefinition\" [macro]\n+endmodule\n+\n+module VERIFICATION\n+  imports MPY\n+  imports VERIFICATION-SYNTAX\n+\n+  rule MinPathDefinition\n+    => FuncDef(\"minPath\", Params(\"grid\", \"k\"),\n+         Assign(Name(\"n\"), Call(Name(\"len\"), Name(\"grid\")))\n+         Assign(Name(\"one_row\"), Int(0))\n+         Assign(Name(\"one_col\"), Int(0))\n+         Assign(Name(\"row\"), Int(0))\n+         While(Compare(Name(\"row\"), CmpOp(\"<\", Name(\"n\"))),\n+           Assign(Name(\"col\"), Int(0))\n+           While(Compare(Name(\"col\"), CmpOp(\"<\", Name(\"n\"))),\n+             If(Compare(\n+                  Subscript(Subscript(Name(\"grid\"), Name(\"row\")), Name(\"col\")),\n+                  CmpOp(\"==\", Int(1))),\n+                Assign(Name(\"one_row\"), Name(\"row\"))\n+                Assign(Name(\"one_col\"), Name(\"col\")),\n+                .Stmts)\n+             Assign(Name(\"col\"), BinOp(\"+\", Name(\"col\"), Int(1))))\n+           Assign(Name(\"row\"), BinOp(\"+\", Name(\"row\"), Int(1))))\n+         Assign(Name(\"neighbor\"),\n+           BinOp(\"+\", BinOp(\"*\", Name(\"n\"), Name(\"n\")), Int(1)))\n+         If(Compare(Name(\"one_row\"), CmpOp(\">\", Int(0))),\n+           Assign(Name(\"neighbor\"),\n+             Call(Name(\"min\"),\n+               Name(\"neighbor\"),\n+               Subscript(\n+                 Subscript(Name(\"grid\"),\n+                   BinOp(\"-\", Name(\"one_row\"), Int(1))),\n+                 Name(\"one_col\")))),\n+           .Stmts)\n+         If(Compare(\n+              BinOp(\"+\", Name(\"one_row\"), Int(1)),\n+              CmpOp(\"<\", Name(\"n\"))),\n+           Assign(Name(\"neighbor\"),\n+             Call(Name(\"min\"),\n+               Name(\"neighbor\"),\n+               Subscript(\n+                 Subscript(Name(\"grid\"),\n+                   BinOp(\"+\", Name(\"one_row\"), Int(1))),\n+                 Name(\"one_col\")))),\n+           .Stmts)\n+         If(Compare(Name(\"one_col\"), CmpOp(\">\", Int(0))),\n+           Assign(Name(\"neighbor\"),\n+             Call(Name(\"min\"),\n+               Name(\"neighbor\"),\n+               Subscript(\n+                 Subscript(Name(\"grid\"), Name(\"one_row\")),\n+                 BinOp(\"-\", Name(\"one_col\"), Int(1))))),\n+           .Stmts)\n+         If(Compare(\n+              BinOp(\"+\", Name(\"one_col\"), Int(1)),\n+              CmpOp(\"<\", Name(\"n\"))),\n+           Assign(Name(\"neighbor\"),\n+             Call(Name(\"min\"),\n+               Name(\"neighbor\"),\n+               Subscript(\n+                 Subscript(Name(\"grid\"), Name(\"one_row\")),\n+                 BinOp(\"+\", Name(\"one_col\"), Int(1))))),\n+           .Stmts)\n+         Assign(Name(\"result\"), ListExpr(.Exprs))\n+         Assign(Name(\"step\"), Int(0))\n+         While(Compare(Name(\"step\"), CmpOp(\"<\", Name(\"k\"))),\n+           If(Compare(\n+                BinOp(\"%\", Name(\"step\"), Int(2)),\n+                CmpOp(\"==\", Int(0))),\n+             Expr(Call(Attribute(Name(\"result\"), \"append\"), Int(1))),\n+             Expr(Call(\n+               Attribute(Name(\"result\"), \"append\"),\n+               Name(\"neighbor\"))))\n+           Assign(Name(\"step\"), BinOp(\"+\", Name(\"step\"), Int(1))))\n+         Return(Name(\"result\")))\n+endmodule\n*** Add File: /work/spec.k\n+requires \"verification.k\"\n+\n+module SPEC\n+  imports VERIFICATION\n+\n+  claim [target-examples]:\n+    <k>\n+      #loadAll(Module(\n+        MinPathDefinition\n+        Assert(Compare(\n+          Call(Name(\"minPath\"),\n+            ListExpr(\n+              ListExpr(Int(1), Int(2), Int(3)),\n+              ListExpr(Int(4), Int(5), Int(6)),\n+              ListExpr(Int(7), Int(8), Int(9))),\n+            Int(3)),\n+          CmpOp(\"==\", ListExpr(Int(1), Int(2), Int(1)))))\n+        Assert(Compare(\n+          Call(Name(\"minPath\"),\n+            ListExpr(\n+              ListExpr(Int(5), Int(9), Int(3)),\n+              ListExpr(Int(4), Int(1), Int(6)),\n+              ListExpr(Int(7), Int(8), Int(2))),\n+            Int(6)),\n+          CmpOp(\"==\",\n+            ListExpr(Int(1), Int(4), Int(1), Int(4), Int(1), Int(4)))))\n+        Assert(Compare(\n+          Call(Name(\"minPath\"),\n+            ListExpr(\n+              ListExpr(Int(4), Int(3)),\n+              ListExpr(Int(2), Int(1))),\n+            Int(5)),\n+          CmpOp(\"==\",\n+            ListExpr(Int(1), Int(2), Int(1), Int(2), Int(1)))))\n+      )) => .K\n+    </k>\n+    <env> 0 </env>\n+    <scopes>\n+      (0 |-> scope(.Map, parent(-1))\n+       -1 |-> builtinsScope) => ?SCOPES:Map\n+    </scopes>\n+    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n+    <heap> .Map => ?HEAP:Map </heap>\n+    <heapLoc> 0 => ?HEAPLOC:Int </heapLoc>\n+    <stack> .List </stack>\n+    <ret> noRet </ret>\n+    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n+    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n+endmodule\n*** End Patch\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019f8d71-e474-70b2-8119-e8b6a9fabb63"}}}
